# Comprehensive Fix Plan: ESLint, Branding, and Tuxemon Integration

Fix ESLint errors preventing Docker build, restore proper "The Lobby" branding, and ensure Tuxemon integration systems are properly organized. This plan addresses immediate build issues while preserving the WebGL upgrade roadmap and Tuxemon MMORPG integration work. Changes are limited to game/The Lobby components only - no changes to landing, home, news, modpacks, streams, or forums pages.

## Project Context
**Saints Gaming Web** is a community management system with an integrated MMORPG called "The Lobby" that incorporates Tuxemon (open-source monster game) via WebGL upgrade. The project is in Phase 4 of Tuxemon integration with 411 species imported and map editing capabilities.

## Scope Verification
All changes are isolated to game/The Lobby components:
- `components/the-lobby/*` (game overlays and logic)
- `app/(main)/lobby/page.tsx` (lobby page only)
- `components/cyber-terminal/` (legacy game component to remove)
- `lib/game/*` (game engine and WebGL renderer)

**No changes to:** landing page, home page, news, modpacks, streams, or forums.

